          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngawa phansi phambi kukaJehova njengakuqala izinsuku ezingamashumi amane nobusuku obungamashumi amane; angidlanga sinkwa, angiphuzanga manzi ngenxa yazo zonke izono zenu enone ngazo ngokwenza okubi emehlweni kaJehova ukuba nimthukuthelise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
